d on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. June to July and November to December each came in under 90% of normal in 39 of those years, the most of any pair. In 2025, August to September came in at 45% of normal and November to December at 45%. Grid 21754 had its driest year in 1953 at 55%.</p>"}
